                                                "sense_id": "e8b58216-0552-36fc-9dab-02b0c9c37f35",
                                                "text": "But since you probably weren’t there, and be thankful for that, here is a quick primer on local, uncivil civics so that you might appreciate the recent political clamor in this part of eastern Tennessee."
